%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: SecurityCall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "\u2026Ici le service s\xE9curit\xE9. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 1
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: 'Bonjour, je suis le majordome Edwin Justice. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: 'Ah enfin, je pensais que vous ne nous appelleriez pas.  '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "D\xE9sol\xE9 d\u2019avoir tard\xE9. Que vouliez-vous me dire ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Eh bien, nous \xE9tions plusieurs \xE0 surveiller la soir\xE9e comme le
      stipulait le contrat. On a aper\xE7u une personne \xE9trange dans la soir\xE9e. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Pouvez-vous me d\xE9crire son comportement ?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "En fait, il servait les invit\xE9s en alcool puis restait immobile dans
      un coin de la salle et partait de temps en temps."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "\u2026Est-ce-que cette personne portait un costume et un n\u0153ud papillon
      ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Oui exactement, vous savez de qui il s\u2019agit ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Il s'agit de moi-m\xEAme. Je servais les invit\xE9s et j\u2019attendais
      leurs demandes."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Ah\u202F! Dans ce cas, je pense que vous avez \xE9t\xE9 le plus suspect
      de tous les individus de la soir\xE9e. C\u2019est tout ce que nous avons remarqu\xE9. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d6cf5ce6282ef48409ae37e87c7d34ae, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Je vois, merci quand m\xEAme. Je suis navr\xE9 de ne pouvoir vous accorder
      plus de temps mais celui-ci me presse. Si vous avez de nouvelles informations,
      n\u2019h\xE9sitez pas \xE0 m\u2019appeler.  "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: Security
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e22a8c6da86b7594db23e3ae1b48600e, type: 2}
